      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You do realize that Unity only allows for a max of 64 active audio sources right? This includes player voices in VRChat, the ones in the world, etc. Hit that limit and either everything goes mute or only certain audio sources can be heard.\nNow whether VRChat is purposefully limiting the active audio sources to 3 on avatars or it's something that Unity is doing is something I don't know. But in any case too many active audio sources is bad even if their volume is set to 0.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
