      "value": "@{5f2cc9743e5e4b3102c1074e|full_name}: It is actually VRChat who is actively disabling any other audio source if it exceeds 3. I tested this and others have shared their experiences with it aswell. I do agree having extreme amounts of audio sources is not good. But a slight increase of the limitations to allow for some more freedom is something that shouldn't be that much of a problem with the current system in mind.",
      "viewerReactions": null
